# KoboFrotz

A Z-Machine interpreter for Kobo E-Readers, based on Frotz V2.43.
Play classic Infocom games (Zork, etc.) on your Kobo!

## Quick Start

```bash
# Requires Docker
./build.sh                              # Build
./build.sh --deploy /path/to/kobo       # Build & Deploy
```

See [BUILD.md](BUILD.md) for detailed instructions.

## Features

- Plays Z-Machine games (.z3, .z5, .z8)
- Optimized for E-Ink displays
- On-screen keyboard
- Touch input support
- NickelMenu integration

## Supported Devices

- Kobo Libra Colour (tested with Firmware 4.44)
- Other Kobo devices with NickelMenu support

